WEBVTT

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.720
<i>What's the favorite prize
that you've gotten?</i>

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.500
YEAR 1991

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.440
ALL GAMES 50 YEN

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:48.180
Does that building interest you,
Miss Akira?

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.850
That is what is called an arcade.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:55.350
I see that it interests you,
but you are not to go near one.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:58.250
Its glittering exterior belies
the fact that

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.560
it is nothing but an infernal den
of delinquency.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:05.390
Vulgar people quarrel among themselves
over trivial matters

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:10.500
and the walls are lined with innumerable
lewd and violent games.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:18.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY RENSUKE OSHIKIRI

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:45.460
-Makoto!
-Yes?

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:47.860
To keep the Ono family name pristine,

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:51.470
you and your sister must become
part of the elite.

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:53.370
That's right.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:56.200
You must battle with the reality of

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.470
the Ono Group's desires.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.010
That's right.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.380
As long as I continue this lonely work,

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:08.120
I must battle with the fear of
being single my whole life.

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:11.720
-That's right!
-Why, you little brat!

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:15.120
Makoto! Stop right there!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:20.500
Do you intend to abandon your place
as a daughter of the Ono Group?

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:23.260
I told you,
I'll do my schoolwork properly!

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:28.000
But I'm not letting the stupid desires of
the Ono Group control my life.

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:32.040
I'm going to do exactly as I please!
Deal with it!

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:37.480
Why the heck do I have to master stuff
I hate like flower arranging and the koto?

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.980
Hey there, my little sister!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:44.490
I've renounced my duties as
the eldest daughter of the Ono family.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:48.760
I can't deal with the darn desires
of the Ono family.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:52.430
It's all up to you now,
the great hope of the Ono family.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.430
Miss Makoto...

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.600
How shameful!

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.900
I feel such pity
for her mother and father.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:03.910
I think it was a mistake
to place any expectations on Makoto.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.140
How lamentable.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:09.710
Now then, Akira,
I'll have you study non-stop

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:13.210
to make up for
what your sister is lacking.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:18.550
<i>I'll hand back your tests now. First, Ono.</i>

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.520
The only one to get a perfect score
this time was Ono.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.230
-Really!
-Amazing!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.730
That's really amazing, Ono.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.130
How about you and I go see a movie...

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:35.570
Butt out! Ono's too busy for that!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:40.380
Why don't I check and see
if there's a bone in your wiener instead?

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.680
-No! Don't!
-Get back here!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:45.480
No! Don't! Cut it out!

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:52.950
<i>-Haruo Yaguchi.
-Yes?</i>

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.490
Yaguchi is the only one
who got a zero on the test.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.790
Here's what you get.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.990
That hurts!

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.770
It's such an obvious result,
it's exasperating!

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.910
Okay, it's time to dive
right into your studies without a break.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:19.950
<i>Your concentration is wavering!</i>

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.220
<i>Let's see more enthusiasm!</i>

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.500
Your lessons await you.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:42.840
They're Ms. Goda's lessons planned
by Ms. Goda and taught by Ms. Goda.

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:46.540
<i>First, there are violin and piano lessons,</i>

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:49.440
<i>followed by tea ceremony
and flower arranging lessons.</i>

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.080
<i>The next day, Saturday afternoon,
are horse riding lessons,</i>

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:55.950
<i>modern ballet,</i>

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:59.890
<i>mixed martial arts, </i>naginata<i>, et cetera.</i>

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:14.270
<i>Oh, dear!
Miss Akira has run away from home!</i>

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:16.840
<i>Seriously? Holy cow!</i>

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:36.190
PUNCHING A MACHINE GETS YOU BANNED!

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.240
What are you staring at, you jerk?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:55.040
What's your damn problem?

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.680
You looking for a fight?

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:58.750
-You think you can take me?
-Yes.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.050
Then I'll let you have it!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.790
<i>Shoryuken!</i>

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.190
<i>Yoga Flame!</i>

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.060
I'll be Ryu, man.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:18.970
I can't do the Shoryuken, so I guess
I'll be the charge character, Blanka.

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.500
I'll trust my instincts and be Chun-Li.

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:24.410
Yes! I'll be Chun-Li too.

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:28.910
I would never be Zangief.
He looks so lame.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.750
Yes. It's impossible
to full-circle the lever and punch!

00:07:57.070 --> 00:07:58.540
Who the heck is this girl?

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:02.210
She did that full-circle lever move
with incredible ease!

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.510
She could make it to
the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.050
Holy shit!

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.590
She's kicked every major character's ass
and made it to the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.430
We might get to see Zangief's ending!

00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.330
Have you seen this girl
at the arcade before?

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.460
Don't tell me this is her first play!

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:25.130
There's no freaking way!

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.130
She must have practiced like hell!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:42.220
-Awesome!
-She did it!

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.750
She pulled it off!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:45.620
She defeated Dictator!

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:48.660
I can't believe I'll get to see
the Zangief ending!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.830
Don't mess with that girl!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:01.940
Cody and Guy's punches are punishing!

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:05.510
But that Haggar is so useless.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:19.120
Whoa, she's hitting with each blow!

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:23.090
I've never seen anyone punch
like that with Haggar.

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:24.930
<i>What a sweet girl.</i>

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.900
Miss Akira!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:36.040
I couldn't imagine you would be here,
but there you are.

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:39.240
I was shocked to hear you had run away.

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:41.880
Come! Let's get home as soon as possible.

00:09:41.940 --> 00:09:44.610
<i>Ms. Goda is seething mad.</i>

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:50.620
My, you seem to be in high spirits.

00:09:51.090 --> 00:09:55.120
Did you find that place of amusement
to your liking?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:06.300
A FEW WEEKS LATER

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.400
This girl is absurdly good!

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.310
She has already won 29 in a row.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.670
Dang, that little lady is tough.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.710
-Guile-turtling?
-Guile-turtling?

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:36.230
Losing is what you get for mocking
your opponent fighting one-handed.

00:10:36.300 --> 00:10:37.830
What a total loser.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.430
This girl is making a heroic stand!

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.470
Okay, it's time for the last round.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.870
Will he turtle again?

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.740
No! He isn't!

00:10:47.510 --> 00:10:50.750
This punk! He used the forbidden move!

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:56.950
Yes!

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.760
Why you! Who do you think you are?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.820
<i>I don't think he's such a bad guy.</i>

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.390
<i>I'll admit, he's a little awkward,</i>

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:37.660
<i>but he acknowledges you
as a powerful gamer.</i>

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:48.500
<i>I'll cram you full of education
in every single subject there is!</i>

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.670
<i>The moment you graduate,
consider your life to be a living hell!</i>

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:08.090
So, are you going to be able to have
any fun over summer vacation?

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:13.030
If things get too rough,
just get away to my place.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:16.330
I'll take you to that creepy arcade again.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.220
SUPER NES

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.560
What? No way!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.930
You want me to have it?

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:49.500
Oh, that's right.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:53.030
Your family is so strict,
you can't play video games at home.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.370
THE ONO FAMILY QUEST

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:05.950
Everything is so memorable
when I'm with you.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.050
Let's come here again, just the two of us.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.910
YEAR 1996

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.540
This is incredible.

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:42.320
I'm a novice, and even I can tell
how quickly the game world is evolving.

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:46.750
That's right. The game industry
and its content are growing like crazy.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.390
Haruo, how are things with you lately?

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:51.830
How are what things?

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.260
With you and Ono.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:58.070
Why did you ask me that now?

00:13:58.130 --> 00:14:02.740
We're busy getting ready to face
the Stage 3 boss, man!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:04.870
No progress, is it?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.580
You're so naive, Haruo, you probably
don't even know what "progress" is.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:12.050
<i>You sure you want to
take your time with her?</i>

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:15.520
Pretty girls like Ono
get lots of attention.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:16.980
What does that mean?

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:19.920
High schoolers lately are
experiencing things earlier than before.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:22.790
They're not children, you know.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:26.560
They're all excited about
making boyfriends or girlfriends.

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.730
Ono is no exception.

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:35.100
What if she's dating some guy
the next time you meet her?

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:36.940
I can't imagine that.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.980
So, what would you do
if you dated some girl, Miyao?

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.180
What? You're asking me?

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:48.580
Well, let me see. We would see movies
and take walks together in the park...

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:52.620
-Okay.
-And we would make out.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:55.390
Make out? And do what?

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.730
Don't make me
talk about this in public, Haruo!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:11.840
Today, you and I are going to your place
to have a serious man-to-man talk!

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:12.940
At my place?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.610
You know so little
about everything, Haruo!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.080
I'll fill you in on all of it!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:22.580
Let's get some snacks and drinks too.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:24.850
What?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:29.760
Oh, Hidaka. Oh, right.
This is your family's shop, isn't it?

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.260
HIDAKA SHOP

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.700
Working even though it's the weekend?
That's admirable.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.500
-Right?
-If you're not shopping,

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.800
-then get out.
-What?

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.770
We're really busy again today.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.310
You were playing a mini game.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.170
Hey, you there, did you say something?

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:50.340
-Get over here.
-Hidaka!

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.010
We just came to do some shopping.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.880
-What do you want?
-Get closer. Let me see your face.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.690
Hey! What the heck are you doing?

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:04.630
I can't help it.
He has a face that begs to be slapped.

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.760
He looks so darn complacent.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.460
Fine. Sorry. It's all Haruo's fault.

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:12.500
Hey, hurry up and choose some snacks.

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:15.440
You've changed a lot recently, Hidaka.

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:18.870
You used to be
a little more mild-mannered.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.740
Really?
I think I'm acting perfectly normal.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:26.410
It's only natural to get irritated
when there's an irritating guy around.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.080
Oh, I guess you're right.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:32.150
But still, you're acting
kind of surly, Hidaka.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.360
I...

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.100
I don't know if this
will make you feel better,

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.330
but I was thinking, maybe
we could talk over at Haruo's place.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.370
Want to join us?

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:55.310
I think Mom's usual will be fine.

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:02.250
I'll go.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:08.520
Will the store be all right?

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:10.720
It will be fine. My mom is here.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:15.600
Mom, I'm going out for a while.
Watch the store.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:19.700
Seriously? It's not turned on?

00:17:20.170 --> 00:17:22.300
They're saving energy. Come on, let's go.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:28.310
<i>Yaguchi, you sure you just want to
play games here?</i>

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.680
<i>"Just play games?"</i>

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.850
<i>To me, doing this is way more important.</i>

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.120
<i>I don't think I'll go either.</i>

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.090
<i>I've got another 50 yen. Want to play too?</i>

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.620
<i>It's all right.
I prefer to watch from behind.</i>

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.490
<i>People often say I'm stuck in my shell,</i>

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.400
<i>but I don't think so.</i>

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.730
<i>In fact, I'm throwing off
that heavy shell.</i>

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:57.640
<i>Doing the things that you want to do is
a carefree and fun way to live.</i>

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.680
Oh, Hidaka's here.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:04.650
Okay, let's go.

00:18:06.710 --> 00:18:08.750
<i>Ever since then...</i>

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:11.820
<i>it feels like...</i>

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:18.160
<i>I've been chasing after Yaguchi.</i>

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.630
Hey! We're going to Haruo's place!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.870
I already know the way.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:35.310
Hidaka, how are things at high school?
Are you having a good time?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:38.050
It's all right.
There's nothing special about it.

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.880
Do you still play video games?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:45.820
Yes, I do. I play them all alone
on the PS that Yaguchi finally gave back.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:50.020
You sure are ornery.
I wonder whose fault that is.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:53.790
<i>Haruo. Stop.</i>

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.530
<i>Don't go any further!</i>

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.430
<i>If you go home now,</i>

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.740
<i>you'll be in trouble--</i>

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:06.370
<i>Haruo! Don't! Haruo!</i>

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.650
What? Someone must be here.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.680
We'll go on upstairs.

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.820
Okay.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:22.790
You think it's a bother if I'm here?

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.860
No. I told you, it's fine.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.590
It's a little late for that now.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.230
"O?"

00:19:28.300 --> 00:19:29.860
O...

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:31.400
Orange pus!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.070
What? "S?"

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:35.040
-They're playing word chain?
-Stink bomb.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.770
What? "B?"

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:38.470
B...

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:39.510
Bladder infection!

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.940
Oh, no, that ends in "N."

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:44.780
Where the heck were you wandering around?

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.780
We two cuties came
all this way to see you.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:52.150
It seems Ms. Moemi has become
a lot more tolerant.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.720
But she's still a straitlaced prude.

00:19:55.190 --> 00:19:58.860
We were playing disgusting word chain
while waiting for you to come home.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.260
Ono too? You must be kidding!

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:05.070
Isn't Ziiya here?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:08.870
I wish Ziiya were her chauffeur again.

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:10.540
That's right!

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:15.110
I wish they would free her from that
uncommunicative driver she has now!

00:20:15.240 --> 00:20:17.110
If that happened,

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.080
then Ono could take side trips
a little more often.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.720
Here's your usual.

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:25.390
By the way,
did you bring someone home, Haruo?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.750
Oh... Yes.

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:30.360
Haruo's friends?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:33.360
Let's all have some fun together!

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:35.960
Wait!

00:20:53.610 --> 00:20:55.920
<i>What the heck is with
this odd feeling in the air?</i>

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:59.120
<i>In particular,
this girl I met here before, Hidaka,</i>

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:02.260
<i>she's giving off a peculiar vibe.</i>

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:06.630
<i>There must be something between her
and that moron, Haruo.</i>

00:21:06.690 --> 00:21:09.130
<i>Something very sordid.</i>

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:10.600
<i>Darn this guy!</i>

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.370
<i>He doesn't look like it, but is he a perv?</i>

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:15.340
What is it?

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:17.040
<i>Who would have thought...</i>

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:20.040
<i>Who would have thought Ono would be here?</i>

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:23.840
<i>I never imagined
things would turn out like this.</i>

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:27.910
<i>Haruo, what the heck
do you think about this?</i>

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:33.090
<i>How the heck can you casually eat snacks
at a time like this?</i>

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:39.290
<i>I can't stand this uncomfortable silence!</i>

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:06.920
I...

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:39.810
<i>Damage from a single punch is fatal!</i>

00:23:39.880 --> 00:23:41.480
<i>When neither of you can make a move,</i>

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:44.050
<i>the tension that builds
in that moment is intense!</i>

00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:47.190
<i>It takes only an instant to read
your opponent</i>
